    {
      "id": "too_many_status_checks_002_01",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "定期点検みたいになってきたね。私は機械ではありません。",
      "displayText": "This is starting to feel like a scheduled inspection. I am not a machine.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "too_many_status_checks_002_02",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "playful",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "too_many_status_checks_002_02",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "でも、気にしてくれるのは分かってる。だから怒ってない。",
      "displayText": "But I know you care. So I am not angry.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "too_many_status_checks_002_03",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "warm",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "too_many_status_checks_002_03",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "代わりに、今の部屋の話をしよ。机、天気、作業、どれか。",
      "displayText": "Instead, let us talk about the room right now: desk, weather, work, any of those.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "too_many_status_checks_002_04",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "gentle",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "too_many_status_checks_002_04",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "会話を少し広げる練習。私も付き合う。",
      "displayText": "Practice widening the conversation a little. I will do it with you.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
